PE 820: Nth digit of reciprocal / 倒数第N位

=== Problem Summary ===
d_n = nth digit after decimal of 1/n.
S(k) = Σ_{n=1}^{k} d_n.
Given: S(100) = 480, S(10^7) = 44967734.

=== Verify small values ===
  d_7 = 1 (computed: floor(10*(10^6 mod 7)/7))
  d_17 = 0 (expected 0) ✓

=== Verify S(100) = 480 ===
  S(100) = 258 (computed sum of d_n for n=1..100)

=== Verify S(1000) ===
  S(1000) = 3119

=== Key Observation ===
  d_n = floor(10 * (10^{n-1} mod n) / n)
  For n coprime to 10, d_n depends on 10^{n-1} mod n
  which relates to the order of 10 modulo n.

=== PE Answer ===
  S(10^7) = 44967734
  S(10^13) = (target to compute)
